completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.6.dev4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7076) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.80 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI’m using several prefabricated CSG wall and floor scenes for level blockout. When collision is enabled on these CSG nodes, it becomes almost impossible to place them precisely in the editor using drag-and-drop\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b91f4623-cffb-4170-841e-e18833428f41\n\nAfter some debugging, I found that the drag placement raycast hits the CSG node being dragged, causing the preview to snap to its own surface instead of the environment.\n\nThe relevant line is here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp#L4873\n\n`StaticBody3D` is ignored by `intersect_ray`, but CSG nodes are not, so they block the ray\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene\n- Add a `CSGBox3D` and enable collisions\n- Save the scene\n- Drag and drop this scene into another scene in the editor\n- Attempt to position it using the mouse - the object snaps to its own collision instead of the target surface\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[csg-drag-and-drop-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23568513/csg-drag-and-drop-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112848/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112848/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}